Remove the no-op unstable_mask Location field for react-router 7.15.0.
react-router 7.15.0 renamed the unstable_mask field on its Location type to mask;
the console still assigns unstable_mask (always undefined, a runtime no-op) in
telemetry.ts and in the jest specs the production webpack build type-checks, so
those files fail to compile until the stale field is dropped. No runtime behavior
changes.
react-router 7.15.0 release: https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router%407.15.0
Upstream source at the pinned commit: https://github.com/openshift/console/blob/c62b7cd934ccfdc9171a874b3bf15d9683f1cb24/frontend/public/components/utils/telemetry.ts

